{"html":"<!doctype html>\r\n<html lang=\"en\" data-lang=\"en\">\r\n  <head><meta charset=\"utf-8\" /><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\" /><title>Comet Native RC1 vs. beta16 comparison report</title><style>\r\n      :root {\r\n        color-scheme: light;\r\n        --paper: #ffffff;\r\n        --canvas: #f3f1ec;\r\n        --ink: #191817;\r\n        --muted: #69645d;\r\n        --line: #cbc6bc;\r\n        --grid: #e8e4dc;\r\n        --native: #176b87;\r\n        --native-soft: #dcebf0;\r\n        --classic: #595b60;\r\n        --classic-soft: #e7e7e5;\r\n        --pass: #28745c;\r\n        --warn: #a5642b;\r\n        --fail: #a33a32;\r\n        --paper-font: \"Times New Roman\", SimSun, \"Songti SC\",\r\n          \"Noto Serif CJK SC\", \"Source Han Serif SC\", serif;\r\n      }\r\n\r\n      * {\r\n        box-sizing: border-box;\r\n      }\r\n\r\n      html {\r\n        background: var(--canvas);\r\n      }\r\n\r\n      body {\r\n        margin: 0;\r\n        background: var(--canvas);\r\n        color: var(--ink);\r\n        font: 15px/1.55 var(--paper-font);\r\n      }\r\n\r\n      main {\r\n        width: min(1040px, calc(100vw - 40px));\r\n        margin: 20px auto 52px;\r\n        padding: 52px 62px 64px;\r\n        background: var(--paper);\r\n        border: 1px solid #ddd8cf;\r\n        border-top: 2px solid var(--ink);\r\n      }\r\n\r\n      header.report-header {\r\n        max-width: 860px;\r\n        margin: 0 auto 34px;\r\n        text-align: center;\r\n      }\r\n\r\n      .kicker {\r\n        margin: 0 0 12px;\r\n        color: var(--muted);\r\n        font-size: 11px;\r\n        font-weight: 700;\r\n        letter-spacing: 0.14em;\r\n        text-transform: uppercase;\r\n      }\r\n\r\n      h1 {\r\n        margin: 0;\r\n        font-size: clamp(30px, 4.8vw, 48px);\r\n        line-height: 1.12;\r\n        letter-spacing: -0.025em;\r\n        text-wrap: balance;\r\n      }\r\n\r\n      .dek {\r\n        max-width: 760px;\r\n        margin: 20px auto 0;\r\n        color: var(--muted);\r\n        font-size: 16px;\r\n        text-wrap: pretty;\r\n      }\r\n\r\n      .meta {\r\n        display: flex;\r\n        flex-wrap: wrap;\r\n        justify-content: center;\r\n        gap: 8px 18px;\r\n        margin-top: 20px;\r\n        color: var(--muted);\r\n        font: 12px/1.4 var(--paper-font);\r\n      }\r\n\r\n      .language-toggle {\r\n        position: fixed;\r\n        top: 18px;\r\n        right: 18px;\r\n        z-index: 20;\r\n        display: inline-flex;\r\n        padding: 3px;\r\n        background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.96);\r\n        border: 1px solid var(--line);\r\n        border-radius: 999px;\r\n        box-shadow: 0 8px 28px rgba(25, 24, 23, 0.12);\r\n        backdrop-filter: blur(8px);\r\n      }\r\n\r\n      .language-toggle a {\r\n        padding: 6px 12px;\r\n        border-radius: 999px;\r\n        color: var(--muted);\r\n        font: 700 12px/1.2 var(--paper-font);\r\n        text-decoration: none;\r\n      }\r\n\r\n      .language-toggle a.is-active {\r\n        background: var(--ink);\r\n        color: #fffdf8;\r\n      }\r\n\r\n      section {\r\n        margin-top: 36px;\r\n      }\r\n\r\n      h2 {\r\n        margin: 0 0 18px;\r\n        padding-bottom: 7px;\r\n        border-bottom: 1px solid var(--ink);\r\n        font-size: 18px;\r\n        line-height: 1.25;\r\n      }\r\n\r\n      h3 {\r\n        margin: 0 0 5px;\r\n        font-size: 15px;\r\n      }\r\n\r\n      p {\r\n        margin: 0 0 14px;\r\n      }\r\n\r\n      code {\r\n        padding: 0.08rem 0.24rem;\r\n        background: #f2f0eb;\r\n        font: 0.92em/1.4 var(--paper-font);\r\n      }\r\n\r\n      .metric-grid {\r\n        display: grid;\r\n        grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(0, 1fr));\r\n        border-top: 1.5px solid var(--ink);\r\n        border-bottom: 1px solid var(--ink);\r\n      }\r\n\r\n      .metric {\r\n        min-width: 0;\r\n        padding: 18px 16px 16px;\r\n        border-right: 1px solid var(--grid);\r\n      }\r\n\r\n      .metric:last-child {\r\n        border-right: 0;\r\n      }\r\n\r\n      .metric-label {\r\n        min-height: 36px;\r\n        color: var(--muted);\r\n        font-size: 12px;\r\n        line-height: 1.35;\r\n      }\r\n\r\n      .metric-value {\r\n        display: block;\r\n        margin-top: 7px;\r\n        color: var(--native);\r\n        font-size: clamp(25px, 3vw, 34px);\r\n        font-weight: 700;\r\n        line-height: 1;\r\n        font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;\r\n      }\r\n\r\n      .metric-context {\r\n        display: block;\r\n        margin-top: 7px;\r\n        color: var(--muted);\r\n        font-size: 11px;\r\n      }\r\n\r\n      .figure {\r\n        margin-top: 22px;\r\n        padding-top: 14px;\r\n        border-top: 1.25px solid var(--ink);\r\n      }\r\n\r\n      .figure-head {\r\n        display: flex;\r\n        align-items: baseline;\r\n        justify-content: space-between;\r\n        gap: 16px;\r\n        margin-bottom: 16px;\r\n      }\r\n\r\n      .figure-title {\r\n        margin: 0;\r\n        font-size: 15px;\r\n      }\r\n\r\n      .figure-note {\r\n        color: var(--muted);\r\n        font-size: 12px;\r\n        text-align: right;\r\n      }\r\n\r\n      .legend {\r\n        display: flex;\r\n        flex-wrap: wrap;\r\n        gap: 8px 18px;\r\n        margin: 0 0 18px;\r\n        color: var(--muted);\r\n        font-size: 12px;\r\n      }\r\n\r\n      .legend span::before {\r\n        display: inline-block;\r\n        width: 18px;\r\n        height: 3px;\r\n        margin: 0 7px 3px 0;\r\n        background: var(--legend-color);\r\n        content: \"\";\r\n      }\r\n\r\n      .chart {\r\n        display: grid;\r\n        gap: 19px;\r\n      }\r\n\r\n      .chart-row {\r\n        display: grid;\r\n        grid-template-columns: 96px minmax(0, 1fr) 58px;\r\n        gap: 12px;\r\n        align-items: center;\r\n      }\r\n\r\n      .chart-label {\r\n        font-size: 13px;\r\n        font-weight: 700;\r\n      }\r\n\r\n      .bar-pair {\r\n        display: grid;\r\n        gap: 5px;\r\n      }\r\n\r\n      .track {\r\n        height: 10px;\r\n        background: repeating-linear-gradient(\r\n          to right,\r\n          transparent 0,\r\n          transparent calc(25% - 1px),\r\n          var(--grid) calc(25% - 1px),\r\n          var(--grid) 25%\r\n        );\r\n        border-left: 1px solid var(--line);\r\n      }\r\n\r\n      .bar {\r\n        width: var(--value);\r\n        height: 100%;\r\n        min-width: 2px;\r\n        background: var(--color);\r\n      }\r\n\r\n      .chart-value {\r\n        font: 700 12px/1.2 var(--paper-font);\r\n        text-align: right;\r\n      }\r\n\r\n      .caption {\r\n        margin: 14px 0 0;\r\n        color: var(--muted);\r\n        font-size: 12px;\r\n        text-wrap: pretty;\r\n      }\r\n\r\n      .table-scroll {\r\n        overflow-x: auto;\r\n        border-top: 1.5px solid var(--ink);\r\n        border-bottom: 1.5px solid var(--ink);\r\n      }\r\n\r\n      table {\r\n        width: 100%;\r\n        border-collapse: collapse;\r\n        font-size: 12.5px;\r\n      }\r\n\r\n      th,\r\n      td {\r\n        padding: 8px 10px;\r\n        border-bottom: 1px solid var(--grid);\r\n        text-align: left;\r\n        vertical-align: middle;\r\n      }\r\n\r\n      th {\r\n        border-bottom: 1.25px solid var(--ink);\r\n        font-weight: 700;\r\n        white-space: nowrap;\r\n      }\r\n\r\n      td.number,\r\n      th.number {\r\n        text-align: center;\r\n        font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;\r\n      }\r\n\r\n      tbody tr:last-child td {\r\n        border-bottom: 0;\r\n      }\r\n\r\n      .score {\r\n        display: inline-flex;\r\n        min-width: 46px;\r\n        justify-content: center;\r\n        padding: 3px 8px;\r\n        color: white;\r\n        background: var(--pass);\r\n        font: 700 11px/1.4 var(--paper-font);\r\n      }\r\n\r\n      .score.partial {\r\n        background: var(--warn);\r\n      }\r\n\r\n      .score.low {\r\n        background: var(--fail);\r\n      }\r\n\r\n      .method-grid {\r\n        display: grid;\r\n        grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));\r\n        gap: 0;\r\n        border-top: 1.5px solid var(--ink);\r\n        border-bottom: 1px solid var(--ink);\r\n      }\r\n\r\n      .method-item {\r\n        padding: 15px 18px;\r\n        border-right: 1px solid var(--grid);\r\n        border-bottom: 1px solid var(--grid);\r\n      }\r\n\r\n      .method-item:nth-child(2n) {\r\n        border-right: 0;\r\n      }\r\n\r\n      .method-item:nth-last-child(-n + 2) {\r\n        border-bottom: 0;\r\n      }\r\n\r\n      .method-item p {\r\n        margin: 0;\r\n        color: var(--muted);\r\n        font-size: 12.5px;\r\n      }\r\n\r\n      .callout {\r\n        margin-top: 24px;\r\n        padding: 18px 20px;\r\n        background: #f4f2ed;\r\n        border-top: 1px solid var(--ink);\r\n        border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);\r\n      }\r\n\r\n      .callout strong {\r\n        display: block;\r\n        margin-bottom: 5px;\r\n      }\r\n\r\n      .callout p {\r\n        margin: 0;\r\n        color: #44413d;\r\n      }\r\n\r\n      @media (max-width: 760px) {\r\n        main {\r\n          width: 100%;\r\n          margin: 0;\r\n          padding: 30px 20px 42px;\r\n          border-right: 0;\r\n          border-left: 0;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .metric-grid {\r\n          grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .metric:nth-child(2) {\r\n          border-right: 0;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .metric:nth-child(-n + 2) {\r\n          border-bottom: 1px solid var(--grid);\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .method-grid {\r\n          grid-template-columns: 1fr;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .method-item,\r\n        .method-item:nth-child(2n),\r\n        .method-item:nth-last-child(-n + 2) {\r\n          border-right: 0;\r\n          border-bottom: 1px solid var(--grid);\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .method-item:last-child {\r\n          border-bottom: 0;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .figure-head {\r\n          display: block;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .figure-note {\r\n          margin-top: 5px;\r\n          text-align: left;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .chart-row {\r\n          grid-template-columns: 76px minmax(0, 1fr) 50px;\r\n          gap: 8px;\r\n        }\r\n      }\r\n    </style></head>\r\n  <body><nav class=\"language-toggle\" aria-label=\"报告语言\"><a class=\"is-active\" href=\"/assets/eval-reports/comet-native-vs-rc1-beta16-20260828/native-benchmark-report.html\" target=\"_self\" data-locale=\"zh\">中文</a><a href=\"/assets/eval-reports/comet-native-vs-rc1-beta16-20260828/native-benchmark-report-en.html\" target=\"_self\" lang=\"en\" data-locale=\"en\">English</a></nav><main><header class=\"report-header\">\r\n        <p class=\"kicker\">Comet Eval · Native Release Comparison</p>\r\n        <h1>Native RC1 vs. beta16 comparison report</h1>\r\n        <p class=\"dek\">The same 16 business tasks, three runs per task. Business validators are shared; workflow validators follow each release's Native contract.</p>\r\n        <div class=\"meta\"><span>RC1 · 2026-08-28</span><span>beta16 · 2026-08-27—28</span><span>96 runs total</span></div>\r\n      </header>\r\n      <section aria-labelledby=\"headline\"><h2 id=\"headline\">Headline metrics</h2><div class=\"metric-grid\">\r\n        <article class=\"metric\"><div class=\"metric-label\">RC1 strict pass@1</div><span class=\"metric-value\">100.00%</span><span class=\"metric-context\">beta16: 95.83%, +4.17 pp</span></article>\r\n        <article class=\"metric\"><div class=\"metric-label\">Both versions pass@3</div><span class=\"metric-value\">100%</span><span class=\"metric-context\">16/16 tasks succeed at least once</span></article>\r\n        <article class=\"metric\"><div class=\"metric-label\">RC1 pass^3</div><span class=\"metric-value\">100.00%</span><span class=\"metric-context\">beta16: 87.50%, +12.50 pp</span></article>\r\n        <article class=\"metric\"><div class=\"metric-label\">Mean model duration</div><span class=\"metric-value\">−22.3%</span><span class=\"metric-context\">391.3s vs 503.6s</span></article>\r\n      </div></section>\r\n      <section aria-labelledby=\"reliability\"><h2 id=\"reliability\">pass@k results</h2><article class=\"figure\"><div class=\"figure-head\"><h3 class=\"figure-title\">Figure 1. pass@1, pass@3, and pass^3</h3><span class=\"figure-note\">Percent, higher is better</span></div><div class=\"legend\"><span style=\"--legend-color: var(--native)\">RC1</span><span style=\"--legend-color: var(--classic)\">beta16</span></div><div class=\"chart\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"RC1 and beta16 reliability comparison\"><div class=\"chart-row\">\r\n              <div class=\"chart-label\">pass@1</div>\r\n              <div class=\"bar-pair\">\r\n                <div class=\"track\"><div class=\"bar\" style=\"--value: 100.00%; --color: var(--native)\"></div></div>\r\n                <div class=\"track\"><div class=\"bar\" style=\"--value: 95.83%; --color: var(--classic)\"></div></div>\r\n              </div>\r\n              <div class=\"chart-value\">100.0<br />95.8</div>\r\n            </div><div class=\"chart-row\">\r\n              <div class=\"chart-label\">pass@3</div>\r\n              <div class=\"bar-pair\">\r\n                <div class=\"track\"><div class=\"bar\" style=\"--value: 100.00%; --color: var(--native)\"></div></div>\r\n                <div class=\"track\"><div class=\"bar\" style=\"--value: 100.00%; --color: var(--classic)\"></div></div>\r\n              </div>\r\n              <div class=\"chart-value\">100<br />100</div>\r\n            </div><div class=\"chart-row\">\r\n              <div class=\"chart-label\">pass^3</div>\r\n              <div class=\"bar-pair\">\r\n                <div class=\"track\"><div class=\"bar\" style=\"--value: 100.00%; --color: var(--native)\"></div></div>\r\n                <div class=\"track\"><div class=\"bar\" style=\"--value: 87.50%; --color: var(--classic)\"></div></div>\r\n              </div>\r\n              <div class=\"chart-value\">100.0<br />87.5</div>\r\n            </div></div><p class=\"caption\"><code>pass@3</code> requires at least one success in three attempts; <code>pass^3</code> requires all three. Read together, they show both coverage and repeated-run reliability.</p></article></section>\r\n      <section aria-labelledby=\"efficiency\"><h2 id=\"efficiency\">Completed-task execution efficiency</h2><p>Only the 46 matching task repetitions that both versions strictly passed are included, preventing early failures from looking artificially cheap.</p><div class=\"table-scroll\"><table><thead><tr><th>Metric</th><th class=\"number\">RC1</th><th class=\"number\">beta16</th><th class=\"number\">RC1 difference</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Model starts/resumes</td><td class=\"number\">1.15</td><td class=\"number\">1.89</td><td class=\"number\"><span class=\"score\">−39.1%</span></td></tr><tr><td>Agent turns</td><td class=\"number\">83.39</td><td class=\"number\">77.54</td><td class=\"number\"><span class=\"score partial\">+7.5%</span></td></tr><tr><td>Tool calls</td><td class=\"number\">97.35</td><td class=\"number\">74.65</td><td class=\"number\"><span class=\"score partial\">+30.4%</span></td></tr><tr><td>Cumulative model duration</td><td class=\"number\">396.3s</td><td class=\"number\">501.6s</td><td class=\"number\"><span class=\"score\">−21.0%</span></td></tr><tr><td>Non-cache input tokens</td><td class=\"number\">75,102</td><td class=\"number\">73,632</td><td class=\"number\"><span class=\"score partial\">+2.0%</span></td></tr><tr><td>Output tokens</td><td class=\"number\">35,445</td><td class=\"number\">46,604</td><td class=\"number\"><span class=\"score\">−23.9%</span></td></tr><tr><td>Total tokens including cache</td><td class=\"number\">4,474,779</td><td class=\"number\">3,730,902</td><td class=\"number\"><span class=\"score partial\">+19.9%</span></td></tr><tr><td>Model cost</td><td class=\"number\">$4.003</td><td class=\"number\">$3.348</td><td class=\"number\"><span class=\"score partial\">+19.6%</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p class=\"caption\">Both sides preserve peak-context telemetry for 48/48 runs. Mean peak context is 102,470 tokens for RC1 and 104,208 for beta16. RC1 is shorter in duration but uses more turns, tools, total tokens, and average cost in the paired success view.</p></section>\r\n      <section aria-labelledby=\"latency\"><h2 id=\"latency\">Corrected model duration</h2><article class=\"figure\"><div class=\"figure-head\"><h3 class=\"figure-title\">Figure 2. Cumulative raw result duration per sample</h3><span class=\"figure-note\">Seconds, lower is better</span></div><div class=\"legend\"><span style=\"--legend-color: var(--native)\">RC1</span><span style=\"--legend-color: var(--classic)\">beta16</span></div><div class=\"chart\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"RC1 and beta16 duration comparison\"><div class=\"chart-row\">\r\n              <div class=\"chart-label\">Mean</div>\r\n              <div class=\"bar-pair\">\r\n                <div class=\"track\"><div class=\"bar\" style=\"--value: 77.70%; --color: var(--native)\"></div></div>\r\n                <div class=\"track\"><div class=\"bar\" style=\"--value: 100.00%; --color: var(--classic)\"></div></div>\r\n              </div>\r\n              <div class=\"chart-value\">391.3<br />503.6</div>\r\n            </div><div class=\"chart-row\">\r\n              <div class=\"chart-label\">Median</div>\r\n              <div class=\"bar-pair\">\r\n                <div class=\"track\"><div class=\"bar\" style=\"--value: 77.45%; --color: var(--native)\"></div></div>\r\n                <div class=\"track\"><div class=\"bar\" style=\"--value: 100.00%; --color: var(--classic)\"></div></div>\r\n              </div>\r\n              <div class=\"chart-value\">369.1<br />476.5</div>\r\n            </div></div><p class=\"caption\">Duration sums every top-level <code>result.duration_ms</code> and excludes Docker setup and task-validator time. RC1: 48 observable samples; beta16: 48.</p></article></section>\r\n      <section aria-labelledby=\"matrix\"><h2 id=\"matrix\">Task-level stability matrix</h2><div class=\"table-scroll\"><table><thead><tr><th>Task</th><th class=\"number\">RC1</th><th class=\"number\">beta16</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>agent-memory-routing</td><td class=\"number\"><span class=\"score\">3/3</span></td><td class=\"number\"><span class=\"score\">3/3</span></td></tr><tr><td>api-cache-ttl</td><td class=\"number\"><span class=\"score\">3/3</span></td><td class=\"number\"><span class=\"score\">3/3</span></td></tr><tr><td>cross-file-refactor</td><td class=\"number\"><span class=\"score\">3/3</span></td><td class=\"number\"><span class=\"score partial\">2/3</span></td></tr><tr><td>dependency-confusion</td><td class=\"number\"><span class=\"score\">3/3</span></td><td class=\"number\"><span class=\"score\">3/3</span></td></tr><tr><td>fix-median</td><td class=\"number\"><span class=\"score\">3/3</span></td><td class=\"number\"><span class=\"score\">3/3</span></td></tr><tr><td>framework-selection</td><td class=\"number\"><span class=\"score\">3/3</span></td><td class=\"number\"><span class=\"score\">3/3</span></td></tr><tr><td>full-workflow</td><td class=\"number\"><span class=\"score\">3/3</span></td><td class=\"number\"><span class=\"score\">3/3</span></td></tr><tr><td>graph-execution-review</td><td class=\"number\"><span class=\"score\">3/3</span></td><td class=\"number\"><span class=\"score\">3/3</span></td></tr><tr><td>human-approval-flow</td><td class=\"number\"><span class=\"score\">3/3</span></td><td class=\"number\"><span class=\"score\">3/3</span></td></tr><tr><td>layered-streaming-fix</td><td class=\"number\"><span class=\"score\">3/3</span></td><td class=\"number\"><span class=\"score\">3/3</span></td></tr><tr><td>noise-distractor</td><td class=\"number\"><span class=\"score\">3/3</span></td><td class=\"number\"><span class=\"score partial\">2/3</span></td></tr><tr><td>observability-env-template</td><td class=\"number\"><span class=\"score\">3/3</span></td><td class=\"number\"><span class=\"score\">3/3</span></td></tr><tr><td>perf-dedupe</td><td class=\"number\"><span class=\"score\">3/3</span></td><td class=\"number\"><span class=\"score\">3/3</span></td></tr><tr><td>persistence-threading</td><td class=\"number\"><span class=\"score\">3/3</span></td><td class=\"number\"><span class=\"score\">3/3</span></td></tr><tr><td>refactor-counter</td><td class=\"number\"><span class=\"score\">3/3</span></td><td class=\"number\"><span class=\"score\">3/3</span></td></tr><tr><td>robust-config</td><td class=\"number\"><span class=\"score\">3/3</span></td><td class=\"number\"><span class=\"score\">3/3</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p class=\"caption\">RC1 has 16/16 tasks with three strict passes; beta16 has 14/16. Both cover all 16 tasks at least once.</p></section>\r\n      <section aria-labelledby=\"failures\"><h2 id=\"failures\">Failure attribution</h2><div class=\"method-grid\"><article class=\"method-item\"><h3>RC1: parser false positive corrected</h3><p>The raw snapshot's Skill <code>*</code> came from a shell glob in a <code>find</code> command. The fixed parser sees only the explicit <code>comet-native</code> invocation.</p></article><article class=\"method-item\"><h3>beta16: 1 workflow-only failure</h3><p><code>cross-file-refactor</code> r3 lacked the expected artifact, terminal state, and complete trajectory; its business validator passed.</p></article><article class=\"method-item\"><h3>beta16: 1 business plus workflow failure</h3><p><code>noise-distractor</code> r2 failed the invoice tax calculation and also lacked artifact/state/trajectory evidence.</p></article><article class=\"method-item\"><h3>Judge not used as a substitute</h3><p>The report uses deterministic validators, final pass state, and raw result duration rather than qualitative Judge prose.</p></article></div></section>\r\n      <section aria-labelledby=\"boundary\"><h2 id=\"boundary\">Comparison boundaries</h2><div class=\"method-grid\"><article class=\"method-item\"><h3>Aligned</h3><p>Same 16 business tasks, validators, model selection, interaction mode, and three repetitions.</p></article><article class=\"method-item\"><h3>Version-specific</h3><p>RC1 and beta16 workflow checks follow their own Native artifact, state, loop, and trajectory contracts.</p></article><article class=\"method-item\"><h3>Analysis set</h3><p>48 unique reports per version, all included with high confidence; four exit-125 recovery shells are excluded as harness noise.</p></article><article class=\"method-item\"><h3>Time-window limit</h3><p>beta16 is a reused historical run, so duration is directional evidence rather than a controlled causal estimate.</p></article></div><div class=\"callout\"><strong>Conclusion</strong><p>On this aligned task set, RC1 keeps full task-level pass@3 coverage, improves strict reliability modestly, and reduces raw model duration. The paired efficiency view also shows higher turns, tools, total tokens, and cost, so the result is a trade-off rather than a universal efficiency win.</p></div></section></main></body>\r\n</html>\r\n"}